        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "我太喜歡這家店了！街角氛圍超棒，葡萄酒和雞尾酒都非常棒。調酒師超級可愛，而且非常熱情。 💖\n\n下次来香港我一定还会再来。真的太棒了！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "I love this place! Such a great vibe in the corner of the street, wine tastes great and cocktail also really nice. The bartender is really adorable and so helpful. 💖\n\nI'll definitely come back here again next time I visit Hong Kong. Truly impressive!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
